{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Cult Vacui</i> \u2013 Demo</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>London, late 19th century.</strong> <br>Night falls over a decaying inn. <br>You are <strong>Henry Gladstone</strong>, and you have only <strong>25 minutes</strong> to escape a demon determined to claim your soul entirely. <br><br>Welcome to <i>Cult Vacui</i>, a pixel art horror-mystery experience where <strong>time is your worst enemy</strong>. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde9 <strong>Simple yet challenging puzzles</strong>: Every minute matters. Can you decipher the clues before it\u2019s too late?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>Evocative pixel art</strong>: Dark environments and decadent details inspired by Victorian gothic aesthetics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc41\ufe0f <strong>Atmosphere of horror and mystery</strong>: A story steeped in dread, possession, and buried secrets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb5 <strong>Original soundtrack</strong>: Composed by Ascari, the music heightens the tension and urgency.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u23f3 You have only <strong>25 minutes</strong>. The demon won\u2019t wait.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3954520?t=1756657659","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3954520?t=1756657659","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954520/091762b53898d761e8bc1de6a63e2aac441ff84b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756657659","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954520/091762b53898d761e8bc1de6a63e2aac441ff84b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756657659","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Custom Volume